1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,645
50,000 people are watching the highest-rated

2
00:00:02,665 --> 00:00:04,370
guy in the city fall apart.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,417
And for the first time in his life, they

4
00:00:06,437 --> 00:00:08,186
can see the one number he's been paying

5
00:00:08,206 --> 00:00:08,710
to hide.

6
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:09,680
Let me back up.

7
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:14,773
In this world, everyone has ratings floating

8
00:00:14,793 --> 00:00:15,660
above their heads.

9
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:16,370
Strength.

10
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:17,480
Athleticism.

11
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:18,140
Health.

12
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:19,020
IQ.

13
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:19,760
EQ.

14
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:20,670
Mental health.

15
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,940
They update live.

16
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:24,460
Go for a run, your athleticism goes up.

17
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:26,640
Skip a night of sleep, your health goes

18
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:27,060
down.

19
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:29,600
Say something cruel, and everyone watches

20
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:30,570
your EQ drop.

21
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,320
And everything runs on them.

22
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:35,050
The café is hiring: EQ 70 and up.

23
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:38,210
The gym is members only: strength 80 plus.

24
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,810
The bank only lends to an 80 overall.

25
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:44,340
And there's one rule everybody follows:

26
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:45,838
you never date anyone more than ten points

27
00:00:45,858 --> 00:00:47,050
away from your own number.

28
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:51,000
This is Theo.

29
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,510
Overall 52.

30
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:53,960
Strength 41.

31
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:55,820
Athleticism 47.

32
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,440
IQ 104.

33
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:59,020
EQ 93.

34
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:01,740
In this city, that's painfully average.

35
00:01:01,970 --> 00:01:03,975
At the very bottom of his card there's a

36
00:01:03,995 --> 00:01:04,820
small grey number.

37
00:01:05,090 --> 00:01:06,790
Potential: 99.

38
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:08,770
Nobody reads the small grey number.

39
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,020
Not even Theo.

40
00:01:10,250 --> 00:01:11,850
Theo is in love with Mia.

41
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,330
Overall 88.

42
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,180
IQ 131.

43
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:16,830
EQ 96.

44
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:18,800
That's a 36-point gap.

45
00:01:19,070 --> 00:01:21,000
In this city, that's not a crush.

46
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:21,860
That's a joke.

47
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:24,515
The thing is, the day they met, Theo wasn't

48
00:01:24,535 --> 00:01:25,210
okay.

49
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,650
His mental health had been sinking for weeks.

50
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:28,760
61.

51
00:01:29,030 --> 00:01:29,730
52.

52
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:30,680
44.

53
00:01:30,910 --> 00:01:32,960
Thousands of people walked past that number.

54
00:01:33,230 --> 00:01:34,090
They could all see it.

55
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,520
Nobody said a word.

56
00:01:35,750 --> 00:01:37,370
Mia was the first one who stopped.

57
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:39,583
She sat down next to him and asked, "Are

58
00:01:39,603 --> 00:01:40,250
you okay?"

59
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:41,530
And then she stayed.

60
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:43,769
Every time she laughed at one of his terrible

61
00:01:43,789 --> 00:01:45,930
jokes, his mental health went up by one.

62
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,800
But when two people look at each other,

63
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:49,320
one more number appears.

64
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:50,470
Compatibility.

65
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:52,740
Theo and Mia: zero percent.

66
00:01:53,010 --> 00:01:54,699
And standing right behind her is the guy

67
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:56,920
she's 97% compatible with.

68
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:57,680
Kai.

69
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:59,280
Overall 94.

70
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:00,830
Strength 97.

71
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:02,520
Athleticism 98.

72
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,880
Two-time champion.

73
00:02:04,110 --> 00:02:06,020
He won't shake hands with anyone under 80.

74
00:02:06,290 --> 00:02:08,000
His EQ is 19.

75
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:10,800
And one line on his card is completely blank.

76
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:12,803
Because if you're rich enough, you can pay

77
00:02:12,823 --> 00:02:14,080
to hide one number.

78
00:02:14,350 --> 00:02:17,250
Kai pays 9,999 a month.

79
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:22,200
Every year the city holds The Ranking.

80
00:02:22,430 --> 00:02:24,410
Three rounds, live on TV.

81
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:27,078
The winner's card turns gold, and gold outranks

82
00:02:27,098 --> 00:02:28,220
every number.

83
00:02:28,450 --> 00:02:29,700
So Theo signs up.

84
00:02:29,970 --> 00:02:32,701
The clerk reads his 52 out loud, and the

85
00:02:32,721 --> 00:02:33,750
whole stadium laughs.

86
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:35,630
Round one, the race.

87
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,570
Kai wins without breaking a sweat.

88
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,470
Theo comes in dead last.

89
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:40,460
By a lot.

90
00:02:40,690 --> 00:02:42,230
Round two, the puzzle.

91
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:44,060
And something strange happens.

92
00:02:44,290 --> 00:02:47,374
Theo's IQ starts climbing, live on the giant

93
00:02:47,394 --> 00:02:47,840
screen.

94
00:02:48,110 --> 00:02:49,120
104.

95
00:02:49,310 --> 00:02:50,340
105.

96
00:02:50,550 --> 00:02:51,640
106.

97
00:02:51,870 --> 00:02:52,940
Second place.

98
00:02:53,210 --> 00:02:56,080
For the first time all day, nobody's laughing.

99
00:02:56,310 --> 00:02:57,910
Then the final is announced.

100
00:02:58,180 --> 00:03:00,338
Partners are random, and every hidden number

101
00:03:00,358 --> 00:03:01,130
gets switched off.

102
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,590
The screen spins.

103
00:03:02,860 --> 00:03:03,640
Theo's partner?

104
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:04,340
Kai.

105
00:03:04,570 --> 00:03:05,570
The filters drop.

106
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:07,760
Every card in the stadium flickers.

107
00:03:07,970 --> 00:03:09,830
And Kai's blank line lights up.

108
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:11,530
Mental health: 12.

109
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,450
It's been 12 for years.

110
00:03:13,670 --> 00:03:15,150
That's what he was paying to hide.

111
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:19,390
The final is a wall.

112
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:22,797
Halfway up, Kai looks down at 50,000 people

113
00:03:22,817 --> 00:03:23,640
reading his number.

114
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:24,450
9.

115
00:03:24,690 --> 00:03:25,370
6.

116
00:03:25,490 --> 00:03:26,060
4.

117
00:03:26,330 --> 00:03:27,140
He freezes.

118
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,160
He can't go up.

119
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,330
He can't go down.

120
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,570
Theo could climb right past him and win.

121
00:03:31,830 --> 00:03:33,770
Instead, he climbs back down.

122
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:34,890
He doesn't pull him.

123
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:35,910
He doesn't push him.

124
00:03:36,130 --> 00:03:37,050
He just talks to him.

125
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,040
"Don't look at them.

126
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:39,280
Look at the next hold.

127
00:03:39,550 --> 00:03:40,550
I'm not going anywhere."

128
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,680
And the whole stadium watches the number

129
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:43,240
come back.

130
00:03:43,510 --> 00:03:43,980
10.

131
00:03:44,210 --> 00:03:45,010
25.

132
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:45,790
40.

133
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:48,110
Hold by hold, they climb together.

134
00:03:48,370 --> 00:03:50,270
They cross the line dead last.

135
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:52,333
Then the judges reveal how the final was

136
00:03:52,353 --> 00:03:52,840
scored.

137
00:03:53,110 --> 00:03:53,990
Not by time.

138
00:03:54,180 --> 00:03:55,880
By how much your ratings changed.

139
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:59,250
Kai's EQ jumped 40 points in one afternoon.

140
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,050
Theo's?

141
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:01,840
Every single stat went up.

142
00:04:02,070 --> 00:04:03,400
His card turns gold.

143
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:06,320
And for the first time, 50,000 people read

144
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:07,740
the small grey number.

145
00:04:08,010 --> 00:04:09,710
Potential: 99.

146
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:15,045
That night, Mia walks right past the 97

147
00:04:15,065 --> 00:04:16,920
and stands next to the zero.

148
00:04:17,150 --> 00:04:19,150
Because compatibility only measures how

149
00:04:19,170 --> 00:04:20,330
alike two people are.

150
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,660
They were nothing alike.

151
00:04:21,930 --> 00:04:22,710
That was the point.

152
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:24,040
Oh, and Kai?

153
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:25,740
He cancelled his privacy plan.

154
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,560
His mental health is right there on his

155
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:28,990
card for everyone to see.

156
00:04:29,260 --> 00:04:30,390
It's 71 now.

157
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:33,218
50 years later, Theo and Mia are still on

158
00:04:33,238 --> 00:04:35,310
the same bench, still holding hands.

159
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:37,790
Compatibility: still zero percent.

160
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:40,120
Mental health: both 100.

161
00:04:40,350 --> 00:04:42,360
And every time she laughs, it still tries

162
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,570
to go up by one.

163
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:46,042
So, if you could hide one rating, which

164
00:04:46,062 --> 00:04:46,820
one would it be?

165
00:04:47,090 --> 00:04:48,090
Tell me in the comments.
